[00:15.000]Sometimes we see what we want to see your need to save us
{"有时我们只愿看见自己想看的　你渴望拯救我们"}
[00:24.400]From pain
{"远离苦痛"}
[00:29.100]Sometimes we deny our common sense to find we are struggling
{"有时我们摒弃理智　只为发现自己在徒劳"}
[00:38.000]In vain
{"挣扎"}
[00:43.000]Don't waste your breath with me
{"别在我身上白费口舌"}
[00:46.500]I know what you hide from me
{"我知道你对我隐瞒什么"}
[00:51.000]Now I'll set you free
{"现在我将放你自由"}
[00:56.000]I'll set you free
{"我会放你自由"}
[00:59.000]Set you free
{"放你自由"}
[01:02.000]Now I'll set you free
{"现在我将放你自由"}
[01:11.000]But the yellow waters faded away
{"但昏黄的水流终将褪去"}
[01:14.500]In the end what's here to stay
{"最后还有什么能永驻"}
[01:18.000]where is a memory I heard inside
{"记忆中回荡的声音在何处"}
[01:25.300]Don't think that I can see
{"别以为我能看透"}
[01:28.500]All the long you've learned from me
{"长久以来你向我学到的所有"}
[01:33.000]Now I'll set you free
{"现在我将放你自由"}
[01:38.000]I'll set you free
{"我会放你自由"}
[01:41.500]Set you free
{"放你自由"}
